#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Setup instructions for IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK and Qiskit Runtime jobs for users with email invitations"
msgid "Setup instructions for IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK and IBM Quantum Compute jobs for users with email invitations"
msgstr "Arahan persediaan untuk IBM Quantum di IBM Cloud bagi menghantar kerja Qiskit SDK dan Qiskit Runtime untuk pengguna dengan jemputan e-mel"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your IBM Cloud account - invited users"
msgstr "Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud anda - pengguna yang dijemput"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your IBM Cloud account - invited users {#set-up-your-ibm-cloud-account-invited-users}"
msgstr "Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud anda - pengguna yang dijemput {#set-up-your-ibm-cloud-account-invited-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not have an invitation from an administrator to join an account that an administrator set up, contact your administrator.  If you need to set up your own account, follow the steps in [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "Jika anda tidak mempunyai jemputan daripada pentadbir untuk menyertai akaun yang telah disediakan oleh pentadbir, hubungi pentadbir anda. Jika anda perlu menyediakan akaun sendiri, ikuti langkah dalam [Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud anda](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "You can run workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs) by setting up an account on IBM Cloud&reg;. You will also need to [install and set up Qiskit and Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgid "You can run workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs) by setting up an account on IBM Cloud&reg;. You will also need to [install and set up Qiskit and IBM Quantum Compute](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menjalankan beban kerja pada unit pemprosesan kuantum (QPU) IBM&reg; dengan menyediakan akaun di IBM Cloud&reg;. Anda juga perlu [memasang dan menyediakan Qiskit dan Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your user account is associated with one or more [instances](/guides/instances), identified by _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRNs) that give access to IBM Quantum services. Additionally, a unique API token (also called a key) is assigned to each account, allowing for IBM Quantum access from Qiskit.  For instructions to choose a specific instance, see [Connect to an instance](/guides/instances#connect-instance).\n"
msgstr "Akaun pengguna anda dikaitkan dengan satu atau lebih [instans](/guides/instances), yang dikenal pasti oleh _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRN) yang memberikan akses ke perkhidmatan IBM Quantum. Selain itu, token API unik (juga dipanggil kunci) diberikan kepada setiap akaun, membolehkan akses IBM Quantum dari Qiskit. Untuk arahan memilih instans tertentu, lihat [Sambung ke instans](/guides/instances#connect-instance).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      The [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) list the instances that you can access.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      [Papan pemuka IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) dan [halaman Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) menyenaraikan instans yang boleh anda akses.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"
msgstr "Sediakan untuk menggunakan IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum anda mula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Accept the email invitation.\n"
msgstr "Terima jemputan e-mel.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in with an IBMid or Google account.  Note that the profile that you use to log in to IBM Cloud or IBM Quantum Platform in this step is not your IBM Cloud account.  After logging in, confirm your information and accept the invitation to join the account.\n"
msgstr "Log masuk dengan akaun IBMid atau Google. Perlu diambil perhatian bahawa profil yang anda gunakan untuk log masuk ke IBM Cloud atau IBM Quantum Platform dalam langkah ini bukan akaun IBM Cloud anda. Selepas log masuk, sahkan maklumat anda dan terima jemputan untuk menyertai akaun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate back to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Navigasi kembali ke [IBM Quantum Platform.](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header, as shown in the following image.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan akaun dan rantau yang betul dipilih dalam penukar akaun di pengepala, seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam imej berikut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the account that was invited in the email.\n"
msgstr "Pilih akaun yang dijemput dalam e-mel.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The region controls where your jobs are run and where the job data is kept. You can access either region by using the same API key, but you can only see and access the instances that were created in the region that you're logged in to.\n"
msgstr "Rantau mengawal di mana kerja anda dijalankan dan di mana data kerja disimpan. Anda boleh mengakses mana-mana rantau menggunakan kunci API yang sama, tetapi anda hanya boleh melihat dan mengakses instans yang dicipta dalam rantau yang anda log masuk.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"
msgstr "    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Optional: Save your access credentials {#2-optional-save-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "2. Pilihan: Simpan kelayakan akses anda {#2-optional-save-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are using a trusted Python environment, such as a personal laptop, it is recommended that you use the `save_account()` method to [save your credentials locally](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Jika anda menggunakan persekitaran Python yang dipercayai, seperti komputer riba peribadi, adalah disyorkan agar anda menggunakan kaedah `save_account()` untuk [menyimpan kelayakan anda secara tempatan.](/guides/save-credentials)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Connect Qiskit with your service instance {#3-connect-qiskit-with-your-service-instance}"
msgstr "3. Sambungkan Qiskit dengan instans perkhidmatan anda {#3-connect-qiskit-with-your-service-instance}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Initialize the service](/guides/initialize-account) in a **trusted Python environment**\n"
msgstr "[Mulakan perkhidmatan](/guides/initialize-account) dalam **persekitaran Python yang dipercayai**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Initialize the service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) (such as a public computer)\n"
msgstr "[Mulakan perkhidmatan dalam **persekitaran yang tidak dipercayai**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) (seperti komputer awam)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"   * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"   * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"   * Ikuti [arahan ini](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) jika anda ingin menyambung menggunakan REST API dan bukannya menggunakan Qiskit.\n"
"   * Jika perlu, gunakan [maklumat ini](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) untuk mengkonfigurasi tembok api anda bagi membolehkan akses ke titik akhir API IBM Quantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Overview of available plans](plans-overview).\n"
"  -  [Configure the Qiskit SDK locally](configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  -  [Gambaran keseluruhan pelan yang tersedia.](plans-overview)\n"
"  -  [Konfigurasi Qiskit SDK secara tempatan.](configure-qiskit-local)\n"
"  -  [Sediakan untuk menggunakan IBM Quantum Platform dengan REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api)\n"
"  -  Ikuti langkah dalam [Hello world](/guides/hello-world) untuk menulis dan menjalankan atur cara kuantum.\n"
"  -  Cuba [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
